 ("ARP maps:", "IP addresses to MAC addresses", "MAC addresses to IP addresses", "Host names to IP addresses", "Ports to processes", "Used on the local link."),
 ("How many usable host addresses are in a /26 subnet?", "62", "64", "30", "126", "2^6 − 2 (network and broadcast)."),
 ("The subnet mask for /20 is:", "255.255.240.0", "255.255.255.240", "255.255.224.0", "255.240.0.0", "20 ones: 8 + 8 + 4."),
