 ("Broadcast address of 192.168.10.0/24?", "192.168.10.255", "192.168.10.0", "192.168.255.255", "255.255.255.0", "All host bits set to 1."),
 ("Network address of 10.1.5.77/22?", "10.1.4.0", "10.1.5.0", "10.1.0.0", "10.1.5.64", "/22 blocks start at multiples of 4 in the third octet."),
 ("Default port for HTTPS?", "443", "80", "8080", "22", "HTTP uses 80."),
 ("ping uses which protocol?", "ICMP", "UDP", "TCP", "ARP", "Echo request and echo reply."),
 ("TCP flow control uses:", "The receiver's advertised window", "Slow start", "Checksums", "TTL", "The sender never exceeds what the receiver can buffer."),
 ("In TCP slow start the congestion window grows:", "Exponentially per round trip", "Linearly per round trip", "Only after loss", "Not at all", "It doubles every RTT until the threshold."),
 ("Which device works at the data link layer?", "Switch", "Hub", "Router", "Repeater", "It forwards by MAC address."),
 ("A MAC address is how many bits long?", "48", "32", "64", "128", "Six bytes, written in hex."),
 ("An IPv6 address is how many bits long?", "128", "32", "64", "48", "IPv4 is 32."),
 ("Which protocol guarantees in-order delivery?", "TCP", "UDP", "IP", "ICMP", "Sequence numbers and retransmission."),
 ("Go-Back-N with n-bit sequence numbers allows a maximum sender window of:", "2^n − 1", "2^n", "2^(n−1)", "n", "One number must stay free to tell new frames from old."),
 ("Selective Repeat with n-bit sequence numbers allows a maximum window of:", "2^(n−1)", "2^n − 1", "2^n", "n − 1", "Sender and receiver windows must not overlap."),
 ("NAT mainly:", "Maps private addresses to a public address", "Encrypts traffic", "Assigns MAC addresses", "Resolves host names", "Many hosts share one public IP."),
 ("In HTTPS the server proves its identity with:", "A certificate signed by a trusted CA", "Its IP address", "A cookie", "Its MAC address", "The browser checks the certificate chain."),
 ("Which HTTP method is idempotent?", "PUT", "POST", "PATCH", "CONNECT", "Repeating PUT leaves the same state."),
 ("HTTP 403 means:", "The server understood the request but refuses to allow it", "The resource does not exist", "Authentication is missing", "The server crashed", "401 is for missing or bad authentication."),
 ("Before opening a TCP connection to a website, the browser usually must:", "Resolve the host name with DNS", "Send an ICMP echo", "Run DHCP", "Open a UDP port 80", "It needs the server's IP address."),
 ("Transmission time of a 1000-byte packet on a 1 Mbps link?", "8 ms", "1 ms", "0.8 ms", "80 ms", "8000 bits / 10^6 bits per second."),
